---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Which Hercio are you today?
description: Nine moods, one Hercio.
permalink: /hercio/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
moods:
  - image: hercio-8
    caption: Reviewing your proposal
    alt: Hercio resting on a sofa with oversized glasses on his head.
  - image: hercio-2
    caption: Overthinking
    alt: Hercio looking sideways with his head lowered.
  - image: hercio-5
    caption: Unavailable
    alt: Hercio asleep across Bartek's head.
  - image: hercio-9
    caption: Cutesy
    alt: Hercio looking straight at the camera with his ears raised.
  - image: hercio-6
    caption: Rawwwr
    alt: Hercio pressing his paw against Bartek's face.
  - image: hercio-1
    caption: Judgmental
    alt: A close-up of Hercio lying in bed with sleepy eyes.
  - image: hercio-4
    caption: Above it all
    alt: Hercio tilting his nose upward from the pillows.
  - image: hercio-7
    caption: Just checking in
    alt: Hercio leaning close to the camera, nose first.
  - image: hercio-3
    caption: Looking into it
    alt: An extreme close-up of Hercio's eye.
---
<section class="hercio" aria-labelledby="hercio-title">
    <h1 id="hercio-title">Which Hercio are you today?</h1>
    <div class="hercio-moods">
        {% for mood in moods %}
        <figure class="hercio-mood">
            <img src="/assets/hercio/{{ mood.image }}.webp" alt="{{ mood.alt }}" sizes="(max-width: 700px) calc(50vw - clamp(20px, 4.3vw, 74px) - 8px), min(352px, calc((100vw - clamp(40px, 8.6vw, 148px) - 64px) / 3))" loading="eager">
            <figcaption class="hercio-caption">{{ loop.index }}. {{ mood.caption }}</figcaption>
        </figure>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
<p class="hercio-disclaimer"><em>I also have another dog, but he didn't consent to having his pictures online.</em></p>
